---
title: Strawberry & Blueberry Overnight Oats
servings: 1
tags:
  - breakfast
  - overnight oats
  - make ahead
---

-- ===Base=== -- Uses the same coconut drink, yoghurt, honey and berries as the Make Me Move smoothie.

Add @Flahavan's oats{50%g}, @unsweetened coconut drink{100%ml}, @vanilla Greek yoghurt{75%g}, @honey{10%g} and @vanilla extract{1/4%tsp} to a #jar{} or #container{}. Stir well until no dry oats remain.

-- ===Berries=== -- Frozen berries thaw overnight and release juice, which loosens the oats slightly.

Fold in @frozen strawberries{50%g} and @frozen blueberries{35%g}, saving a few of each to press onto the top.

-- ===Chill===

Cover and refrigerate for ~soaking{6-10%hours}, ideally overnight.

-- ===Morning adjustments=== -- Oats keep absorbing liquid, so check consistency before eating.

If too thick, stir in @unsweetened coconut drink{15%ml}.
If too tart, drizzle over a little extra @honey{5%g}.
If not creamy enough, top with a spoonful of @vanilla Greek yoghurt{30%g}.